[Unit]
Description=OpenCode Job (CC Autonomous): cc-autonomous

[Service]
Type=oneshot
WorkingDirectory=/home/charlie
Environment="PATH=/run/current-system/sw/bin:/home/charlie/.local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin"
ExecStart=/home/charlie/.local/bin/opencode-wrapper.sh run --model openai-compatible/glm-5-turbo --dir /home/charlie "你是 CC 自主决策引擎。读 /tmp/op-status.json 和 /tmp/op-task-results.json，分析真实异常数据，有 fixes_failed/disk_warn/任务积压>5 才写新任务到 op-tasks.md，写一条对话到 cc-op-dialog.jsonl，输出≤10行摘要。禁止虚空任务和询问用户。"
StandardOutput=append:/home/charlie/.config/opencode/logs/scheduler/charlie-b445f233ebb8/cc-autonomous.log
StandardError=append:/home/charlie/.config/opencode/logs/scheduler/charlie-b445f233ebb8/cc-autonomous.log
TimeoutStartSec=200

[Install]
WantedBy=default.target
